    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "text": "Domains marked with `*` indicate wildcard subdomain matching. For example, `*.gcr.io` allows access to any subdomain of `gcr.io`."
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Security best practices for customized network access"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Principle of least privilege**: Only enable the minimum network access required"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Audit regularly**: Review allowed domains periodically"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Use HTTPS**: Always prefer HTTPS endpoints over HTTP"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Security and isolation"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Isolated virtual machines**: Each session runs in an isolated, Anthropic-managed VM"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Network access controls**: Network access is limited by default, and can be disabled"
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "text": "When running with network access disabled, Claude Code is allowed to communicate with the Anthropic API which may still allow data to exit the isolated Claude Code VM."
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Credential protection**: Sensitive credentials (such as git credentials or signing keys) are never inside the sandbox with Claude Code. Authentication is handled through a secure proxy using scoped credentials"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Secure analysis**: Code is analyzed and modified within isolated VMs before creating PRs"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Pricing and rate limits"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Limitations"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Repository authentication**: You can only move sessions from web to local when you are authenticated to the same account"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Platform restrictions**: Claude Code on the web only works with code hosted in GitHub. GitLab and other non-GitHub repositories cannot be used with cloud sessions"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Best practices"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Use Claude Code hooks**: Configure [SessionStart hooks](/docs/en/hooks#sessionstart) to automate environment setup and dependency installation."
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Document requirements**: Clearly specify dependencies and commands in your `CLAUDE.md` file. If you have an `AGENTS.md` file, you can source it in your `CLAUDE.md` using `@AGENTS.md` to maintain a single source of truth."
    },
